    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Cheerful: Enjoys making people laugh | Obsession: Fixated on laughter | Cleverness | Pseudobulbar Affect (PBA): Inappropriate laughter or attempts to induce laughter at inappropriate times | Anger towards the wealthy: Discovers they are the illegitimate child of a famous politician and becomes enraged (struggles with being seen as the child of someone they previously rejected) | Childhood abuse: Abused by a mother figure in childhood, leading to memories of abuse and a desire for revenge (unlike most people who may resent their mother, they contemplate murder)"
      }
    ],
