        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 80
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Obsession: Driven by a lifelong fixation on capturing the \"Monster of Paradise Falls,\" leading him to sacrifice decades of his life and his moral integrity to prove his skeptics wrong. | Ruthlessness: Exhibiting a total lack of empathy, willing to eliminate anyone—including an elderly fan and a young child—who stands between him and his objective. | Cleverness: Technological Supremacy |Arrogance: Utilizing his genius-level intellect to create advanced canine-translation collars and a massive dirigible, asserting his dominance over nature and his subjects through technological control."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/gender": [
      {
        "@value": "Male"
      }
