        "@value": "Tragic backstory: Formerly kind-hearted, turned evil after not being invited to Aurora's christening. (Warns Aurora that she will die on her 16th birthday) | Wickedness: Commits murder for personal gain. | Narcissism: Views others as beneath them (treats them like pets)."
      }
    ],
