    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "External Mask: Paradoxical Facade — Maintaining a facade of paternalistic concern and \"friendliness\" to mask a parasitic system of extortion and labor exploitation. | Authoritarianism: Enforcing absolute control over the waterfront through the systematic use of violence, intimidation, and cold-blooded murder. | Greedy: Exploiting the labor of the working class to fuel a criminal enterprise while viewing human lives as disposable commodities for profit. | Corrupt Loyalty: Prioritizing the \"code of silence\" and organized crime alliances over legal standards and the welfare of the union members."
      }
    ],
