    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Racial Discrimination: Engaging in collective acts of racial discrimination alongside a peer group. |  Subjugative Morality: Harboring a distorted moral compass that demands the total subservience of all Black individuals. | Socialite Status: Maintaining a prominent and well-connected reputation within elite high-society circles. | Irrationality: Delusional Idealism. Paradoxically self-identifying as an \"idealist\"; believing in one's own inherent nobility while remaining in total denial of their racist reality"
      }
    ],
