    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Nihilism: Moral Indifference — Operating in a world torn by the Civil War with total indifference to the political or human cost, viewing the conflict merely as a chaotic backdrop for his personal enrichment. | Patient: Strategic Stalking — Demonstrating a high degree of patience and strategic foresight, willing to wait and manipulate others to lead him to his ultimate goal (the hidden gold)."
