    "http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails": [
      {
        "@value": "Obsessive Legacy: Maintaining a pathological fixation on paternal history and the preservation of lineage through a symbolic pocket watch. |  Sadistic Ruthlessness: Executing extreme violence with surgical precision and chilling indifference to confirm absolute power over the weak. |  Misogynistic Objectification: Viewing women solely as biological vessels for male heirs while dismissing their individual humanity and autonomy. | Authoritarian Discipline: Enforcing a rigid military hierarchy and meticulous order to suppress any form of dissent or perceived chaos. | Narcissistic Fragility: Concealing deep-seated insecurity and fear of failure behind a facade of stoic perfectionism and terrifying aggression."
