        "@value": "Ruthlessness Ambition: Willing to kidnap and harm innocent children using experimental technology to secure personal power and corporate fame. | Cunning Manipulation: Utilizing high intelligence and camouflaging abilities to orchestrate secret plots while feigning cooperation with superiors. | Vengefulness: Maintaining a long-term grudge over past academic humiliations and seeking to destroy rivals through disproportionate retaliation. | Sadistic: Exhibiting a total lack of empathy and deriving satisfaction from the psychological terror of victims during the forced extraction of screams."
      }
    ],
