    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Obsession: Pursuing a fanatical obsession with a deceased lover to recreate or replace her through technological means. | Vengefulness: Executing calculated revenge driven by deep-seated hatred to destroy a rival and their legacy. | Delusion: Losing the grip on reality due to emotional instability and confusing living individuals with a lost past. | Manipulation: Feigning cooperation with authority while orchestrating chaos to fulfill a private agenda. | Egotism: Perceiving oneself as a god-like creator while disregarding moral boundaries for technical achievement."
      }
    ],
