    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Values order: Prefers following manuals. Order over Humanity — Prioritizing the maintenance of a strict, arbitrary schedule above the actual recovery or well-being of the patients, viewing any chaos as a personal affront. | Narcissism: Moral Self-Validation — Believing her methods are inherently correct because they are validated by the institution, lacking the capacity for self-reflection or remorse."
      }
    ],
